r started?","chinese":"你知不知道谣言是从哪儿传出来的？"},{"english":"the custom started in the Middle Ages","chinese":"这一习俗始于中世纪"}]},{"id":"starting:o:10798479d8e3","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"开始做","glossesEn":["begin doing sth"],"examples":[{"english":"can you start on Monday?","chinese":"你能星期一开始上班吗？"},{"english":"it’s a long story; where shall I start?","chinese":"说来话长，我该从哪儿说起呢？"},{"english":"the best professional musicians start young","chinese":"顶尖的音乐家都从小就接触音乐"}]},{"id":"starting:o:f60ef1230df5","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"开始说","glossesEn":["begin saying sth"]},{"id":"starting:o:c49f60693042","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"首先做","glossesEn":["do as a first stage"],"examples":[{"english":"let’s start by reviewing what we did last week","chinese":"我们先来复习一下上周学的内容"},{"english":"let's start with the case you mentioned","chinese":"我们先来说说你提到的情况"},{"english":"she started as a secretary but ended up running the department","chinese":"她起初是一位秘书，但最后掌管了整个部门"}]},{"id":"starting:o:9ddd0701a03b","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"开头是","glossesEn":["have as a first stage"],"examples":[{"english":"the day started badly: I overslept!","chinese":"那天一开始就不顺利，我睡过了头！"},{"english":"her name starts with (an) M","chinese":"她名字的首字母是M"},{"english":"this is where the desert starts","chinese":"沙漠从这里延伸开去"}]},{"id":"starting:o:98ff20c5f5c0","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"起始","glossesEn":["have as a starting point"]},{"id":"starting:o:6af2d8976046","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"出发","glossesEn":["leave"],"examples":[{"english":"we must start at 6 o'clock","chinese":"我们必须6点钟动身"},{"english":"I started after her to tell her the news","chinese":"我起身朝她追去，要把消息告诉她"},{"english":"he started for the door, but I blocked his way","chinese":"他向门口走去，但我拦住了他"}]},{"id":"starting:o:171b0d3e4053","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"开始走","glossesEn":["begin to move"]},{"id":"starting:o:31af378246e7","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"启动","glossesEn":["begin to operate"],"examples":[{"english":"the car won't start","chinese":"这辆车发动不起来"}]},{"id":"